    <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
    <tr>
        <td id="descriptionArea">
            <p><b>Steps:</b></p>
<ul>
	<li>Go to the Gregory Olsen photo studio site (<a href="https://photostudio.demohoster.com/" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener">https://photostudio.demohoster.com/</a>)</li>
	<li>Go to Header &gt;session</li>
	<li>Click on Book now Mini Studio Session </li>
	<li>Click on Book</li>
	<li>Fill each alpha-type field with the following inputs:<br/>
empty space – " "</li>
	<li>Click on the Continue to payment button</li>
</ul>


<p><b>Actual result:</b> All accepted without any validation error message </p>

<p><b>Expected result:</b> Form should treat whitespace-only input as empty and block submission, showing the corresponding "required" error message</p>
            <br/>
        </td>
    </tr>
    </table>

