</ul>


<p><b>Actual Result:</b> The link redirects to the URL “<a href="https://www.instagram.com/ph_olsen" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener">https://www.instagram.com/ph_olsen/#</a>” </p>

<p><b>Expected Result:</b> The link should redirect to Greg’s instegram URL “<a href="https://www.instagram.com/ph_gr.olsen/" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener">https://www.instagram.com/ph_gr.olsen/</a>”</p>
