    <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
    <tr>
        <td id="descriptionArea">
            <p><b>Steps:</b></p>
<ul>
	<li>Go to the Gregory Olsen photo studio site (<a href="https://photostudio.demohoster.com/" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener">https://photostudio.demohoster.com/</a>)</li>
	<li>Go to Header &gt;session</li>
	<li>Click on Book now Mini Studio Session </li>
	<li>Click on Book</li>
	<li>Leave the Company field empty.</li>
	<li>Fill in all other required fields correctly.</li>
	<li>Click "Continue to payment method."</li>
</ul>


<p><b>Actual result:</b> Form blocks submission and shows a required-field validation error for Company name</p>

<p><b>Expected result:</b> Form should submit successfully with Company left empty</p>
            <br/>
        </td>
    </tr>
    </table>

