        <td id="descriptionArea">
            <p><b>Steps:</b></p>
<ul>
	<li>Go to the Gregory Olsen photo studio site (<a href="https://photostudio.demohoster.com/" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener">https://photostudio.demohoster.com/</a>)</li>
	<li>Go to Header &gt;session</li>
	<li>Click on Book now Standard session </li>
	<li>Dropdown Additional Subjects </li>
</ul>


<p><b>Actual result:</b> Additional subjects dropdown shows 7 values from 1 to 7</p>

<p><b>Expected result:</b> Additional subjects dropdown should have 10 values + none</p>
