</ul>


<p><b>Actual result:</b> Clicking the photo does not navigate anywhere, remain on that page</p>

<p><b>Expected result:</b> Should navigate to <a href="https://www.facebook.com/LaurenLuciaDesigns" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener">https://www.facebook.com/LaurenLuciaDesigns</a></p>
            <br/>
        </td>
    </tr>
    </table>

