    <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
    <tr>
        <td id="descriptionArea">
            <p><b>Steps:</b></p>
<ul>
	<li>Go to the Gregory Olsen photo studio site (<a href="https://photostudio.demohoster.com/" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener">https://photostudio.demohoster.com/</a>)</li>
	<li>Go to Connect &gt; Clients</li>
	<li>Click on Caleb Colpitts's photo</li>
	<li>Check the destination URL</li>
	<li>Go back and again click on Alex Ching's photo.</li>
	<li>Check the destination URL</li>
</ul>


<p><b>Actual result:</b> Clicking Caleb Colpitts's photo opens Kate Cleaves's link (<a href="http://www.katecleaves.com/" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener">http://www.katecleaves.com</a>). Clicking Alex Ching's photo opens Maclaren's link (<a href="http://www.maclarenbaby.com/" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener">http://www.maclarenbaby.com/</a>)</p>

<p><b>Expected result:</b> Caleb Colpitts's photo should link to <a href="http://calebcolpitts.com/" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener">http://calebcolpitts.com/</a>. Alex Ching's photo should have no link</p>
            <br/>
        </td>
    </tr>
