    <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
    <tr>
        <td id="descriptionArea">
            <p><b>Steps:</b></p>
<ul>
	<li>Go to the Gregory Olsen photo studio site (<a href="https://photostudio.demohoster.com/" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener">https://photostudio.demohoster.com/</a>)</li>
	<li>Navigate to Work tab dropdown and select Portrait</li>
	<li>click on a picture </li>
	<li>see on top right corner </li>
	<li>switch photos and check image expand option</li>
	<li>click on outside of the picture </li>
	<li>move to the other galleries </li>
	<li>do the same thing for other galleries' pictures</li>
</ul>


<p><b>Actual result:</b> In some photo showing expand image option and some others are not</p>

<p><b>Expected result:</b> All preview photos should display an expand image on hover</p>
