            <p><b>Steps:</b></p>
<ul>
	<li>Go to the Gregory Olsen photo studio site (<a href="https://photostudio.demohoster.com/" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener">https://photostudio.demohoster.com/</a>)</li>
	<li>Open a gallery from Work tab (Portrait, Lifestyle, Travel, or Motion)</li>
	<li>Hover the mouse over any preview photo.</li>
</ul>


<p><b>Actual result:</b> No tooltip is displayed on hover in any of the Work gallery submenus</p>

<p><b>Expected result:</b>  A tooltip should appear showing the photo number (e.g. "p5") when hovering over a preview photo</p>
