	<li>Click "Next"</li>
	<li>Click "Next" again</li>
</ul>


<p><b>Actual result:</b> Clicking "Next" on page 3 goes back to page 2, and clicking "Next" again returns to page 3.Creating a loop between pages 2 and 3, with page 4 never reached<span class="nobr"><a href="https://jira.a1qa.com/secure/attachment/2823167/2823167_Recording+2026-08-03+132022.mp4" title="Recording 2026-08-03 132022.mp4 attached to QATC-1014317">Recording 2026-08-03 132022.mp4<sup><img class="rendericon" src="https://jira.a1qa.com/images/icons/link_attachment_7.gif" height="7" width="7" align="absmiddle" alt="" border="0"/></sup></a></span></p>

<p><b>Expected result:</b>  ** Clicking "Next" on page 3 needs to go forward to page 4</p>
