        <td id="descriptionArea">
            <p><b>Steps:</b></p>
<ul>
	<li>Go to the Gregory Olsen photo studio site (<a href="https://photostudio.demohoster.com/" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener">https://photostudio.demohoster.com/</a>)</li>
	<li>Hover the mouse cursor over any header navigation option work &gt; portrait without clicking</li>
	<li>Observe the bottom-left corner of the browser window</li>
</ul>


<p><b>Actual result:</b> The URL address of the corresponding page is displayed in the bottom-left corner of the browser when hovering over any header option.</p>

<p><b>Expected result:</b> No URL should be displayed when hovering over header navigation options.</p>
